HB0099 Access to public lands-corner crossing.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Provenza, Andrew, Campbell, E,
Larson, JT and Wharff and Senator(s) Jones, Rothfuss
and Schuler
AN ACT relating to crimes and offenses; providing an exception to the offenses
of criminal trespass and game-and-fish trespass regarding incidental contact
associated with crossing two (2) adjacent parcels as specified; and providing
for an effective date.
